msgid ""
"Edit the menu structure as JSON. Each item can have: name, icon, command "
"(run through the shell) or action (a session action: lock, logout, leave, "
"switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (array of items), "
"or separator (true)."
msgstr "मेनू-संरचनां JSON रूपेण सम्पादयतु। प्रत्येकस्मिन् वस्तुनि एतानि भवितुम् अर्हन्ति: name, icon, command (शेल्-द्वारा चाल्यते) अथवा action (सत्र-क्रिया: lock, logout, leave, switchUser, suspend, hibernate, reboot, shutdown), submenu (वस्तूनां सरणी), अथवा separator (true)।"

